{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2012-common-biology-29","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2012,"subject":"biology","number":29,"points":2,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"RNA·엑손·스플라이싱","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene","digestion"],"stem":"그림은 사람의 apolipoprotein B 단백질이 간에서는 100 kDa의 \nApo-B100으로, 소장에서는 RNA 편집(RNA editing)에 의해 48 kDa의\nApo-B48로 생성되는 것을 나타낸다.\n그림에서 소장에 존재하는 apolipoprotein B mRNA에 대한 설명으로\n옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 엑손 일부가 선택적 스플라이싱(alternative splicing)에 의해 \n결손되어 Apo-B48이 만들어졌다.\nㄴ. 시티딘 탈아민화효소(cytidine deaminase)가 작용하였다. \nㄷ. 종결코돈이 새로운 위치에 생성되었다.   ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":411,"height":27,"region":0,"bbox":[90.3,66.903,164.4,10.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-common-biology-29/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":625,"height":183,"region":0,"bbox":[45.1,90.503,250.0,73.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-common-biology-29/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":228,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,224.103,310.4,91.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2012-common-biology-29/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":16,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,516.622],"width":334.1,"height":364.325,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[90.3,66.903,164.4,10.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[4